4.16.m:
The people said:
“O masters, what is to be done? The wicked ones have arrived;
many people have been harmed, and they have come near!”

The command, “Kill them, strike them!” was spoken by Dūṣaṇa;
that word uttered by the Daitya was not heard at all by those twice-born,
the sons of Vedapriya, who were devoted to the path of meditation on Śambhu.
